WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.980
We’ve been having problems with the plant early on, because I remember when it would explode,

2
00:00:05.980 --> 00:00:08.540
we didn’t have an alarm but the whistle to go off.

3
00:00:08.540 --> 00:00:12.120
But the police would come in, I say police but the sheriffs would come,

4
00:00:12.120 --> 00:00:17.820
and they would tell us to hurry up and get out, and we ran.

5
00:00:17.820 --> 00:00:25.160
Sometimes we were in our sleeping clothes, barefooted, and we were running Old Spanish Trail where gators were.

6
00:00:25.160 --> 00:00:31.250
They had gators in there, they had moccasins crossing the road, because don’t forget we talking about swamp land.
